# Dependencies and build output are recreated inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/out
**/*.egg-info
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]

# Tooling caches
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.pytest_cache
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# VCS and CI
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Secrets must come from the runtime environment, never baked into a layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local-only noise
**/*.log
debug.log
**/next-dev.log
**/next-dev.err.log
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Docs and design artifacts that do not belong in an image
docs
*.md
!README.md
*.docx
*.html
api-gateway/uploads
